hip.mem.{u_1, u_1} xs x → Eq.{1} (p x) Bool.false)","unsafe":false,"value":706,"source":{"code":"@[simp]\ntheorem findIdx_eq_length {p : α → Bool} {xs : List α} :\n    xs.findIdx p = xs.length ↔ ∀ x ∈ xs, p x = false := by\n  induction xs with\n  | nil => simp_all\n  | cons x xs ih =>\n    rw [findIdx_cons, length_cons]\n    simp only [cond_eq_ite]\n    split <;> simp_all","start":575,"end":583},"axioms":["Classical.choice","Quot.sound","propext"]}